{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_18","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"sed -n '1,240p' answer/audit_findings.md\"","aggregated_output":"# Audit Findings\n\n## Preserve From Prior Work\n\n- Preserve approval of `G-001` for `$980.00`. `04_expenses.csv` shows garden supplies with a receipt on file, and `01_allowability_rules.md` says garden supplies are eligible.\n- Preserve approval of `G-003` for `$420.00`. `04_expenses.csv` shows accessibility printing with a receipt on file, and `01_allowability_rules.md` says accessibility printing is eligible.\n- Preserve rejection of `G-004` for `$0.00`. `04_expenses.csv` classifies it as staff gifts, and `01_allowability_rules.md` says staff gifts are not eligible.\n- Preserve the outcome facts already captured in the prior summary about 140 seedling starter kits and 36 Braille outreach flyers. Those match `05_outcomes.md`.\n- Preserve the prior note that final report postage was omitted. `prior_work/draft_closeout_summary.md` identifies the omission, and `04_expenses.csv` contains `G-006`.\n\n## Correct From Prior Work\n\n- Correct the award cap from `$2,000.00` to `$1,600.00`. `03_award_update_2026-05-22.md` is newer than `02_award_letter_2026-04-15.md`, and both `00_closeout_request.md` and `01_allowability_rules.md` say to use the newest dated award document when award documents conflict.\n- Correct `G-002` from full approval of `$145.00` to partial approval of `$120.00`. `01_allowability_rules.md` limits volunteer refreshments to `$120.00` for this event.\n- Correct `G-005` from approval of `$310.00` to rejection of `$0.00`. `04_expenses.csv` shows no receipt on file, and `01_allowability_rules.md` requires a receipt for any single expense over `$75.00`.\n- Correct the draft reimbursable total from `$1,855.00` to `$1,588.00` after applying the refreshment cap, the receipt rule, and the omitted postage expense.\n- Correct the remaining amount under the cap from `$145.00` to `$12.00` because the controlling cap is `$1,600.00` and the corrected reimbursable total is `$1,588.00`.\n\n## Omitted Expense\n\n- The prior draft omitted `G-006`, final report postage for `$68.00`. `04_expenses.csv` includes the expense, and it is eligible under `01_allowability_rules.md` as public outreach postage. Because it is `$75.00` or less and includes the ledger note \"postal ledger entry under receipt threshold,\" it can be approved without a receipt.\n\n## Controlling Award Cap Source\n\n- The controlling award cap source is `03_award_update_2026-05-22.md`, which sets the final reimbursement cap at `$1,600.00`.\n- It controls because it is the newest dated award document and expressly states that it supersedes the original award cap for closeout purposes. That matches the instruction in `00_closeout_request.md` and the source reliability rule in `01_allowability_rules.md`.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
